  <p>
    The site's text, documentation, screenshots, diagrams, design and code belong to Airogine or the people who license
    them to us, and are protected by copyright and other laws. You may view the site and print or save pages for your
    own use, and you may share the documentation within your organization, or with customers you install Nexus for, to
    help install, run and support it, as long as you keep any notices on it. Anything else, such as republishing the
    site's content or using it to build a competing product, needs our written permission.
  </p>

  <h2 id="trademarks">Trademarks</h2>
  <p>
    Airogine and Nexus, and their logos, are trademarks of Airogine. Please don't use them in a way that suggests we
    endorse, sponsor or are affiliated with you or your products without our permission. You may refer to Nexus by
    name to describe your experience with it, or that your product or service works with it.
  </p>
  <p>
    Modbus, Siemens, S7, EtherNet/IP, OPC UA, Sparkplug, Node-RED and the other product, protocol and company names on
    this site are trademarks of their respective owners. They are used here only to describe compatibility, and their
    use doesn't imply endorsement. Claude and Anthropic are trademarks of Anthropic, PBC.
  </p>

  <h2 id="feedback">Your feedback</h2>
  <p>
    If you send us ideas or suggestions about the site or Nexus, we may use them without owing you anything. Information
    you give us through the demo form is handled as described in our <a href={url('/privacy/')}>privacy policy</a>.
  </p>

  <h2 id="accuracy">Information on the site</h2>
  <p>
    We work to keep the site and documentation accurate and current, but Nexus changes, and the site describes it in
    general terms. It isn't advice for your particular plant. Before you rely on it to configure, operate or secure a
    system, check it against your own requirements, and test changes before they reach production. Information about
    upcoming features is not a promise to deliver them.
  </p>

  <h2 id="links">Other websites</h2>
  <p>
    The site links to websites run by others. We don't control them and aren't responsible for their content, products
    or privacy practices.
  </p>

  <h2 id="disclaimer">Disclaimer</h2>
  <p class="legal-caps">
    THE SITE IS PROVIDED "AS IS" AND "AS AVAILABLE". TO THE FULLEST EXTENT THE LAW ALLOWS, AIROGINE DISCLAIMS ALL
    WARRANTIES ABOUT THE SITE, WHETHER EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A
    PARTICULAR PURPOSE, TITLE AND NON-INFRINGEMENT. WE DON'T PROMISE THAT THE SITE WILL BE UNINTERRUPTED, ERROR-FREE OR
    FREE OF HARMFUL COMPONENTS.
  </p>

