    TO THE FULLEST EXTENT THE LAW ALLOWS, AIROGINE WILL NOT BE LIABLE FOR ANY INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL,
    CONSEQUENTIAL OR PUNITIVE DAMAGES, OR FOR ANY LOSS OF PROFITS, REVENUE, DATA OR PRODUCTION, ARISING FROM OR RELATED
