    THE SITE IS LIMITED TO ONE HUNDRED US DOLLARS (US$100). SOME JURISDICTIONS DON'T ALLOW SOME OF THESE LIMITS, SO THEY
    MAY NOT ALL APPLY TO YOU.
  </p>

  <h2 id="indemnity">Your responsibility</h2>
  <p>
    If you use the site in breach of these terms and that leads to a claim against Airogine, you agree to cover the
    resulting losses and reasonable costs, to the extent the law allows.
